# An application inside an object, which binds an attribute of the object.
#
#   ⟦ a ↦ ⟦ times ↦ ⟦ ρ ↦ ∅, x ↦ ∅, λ ⤍ L_times ⟧, Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-06, f ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-07 ⟧, t ↦ ξ.times(x ↦ ξ.f) ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.a.t ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.169.

F c0 a foo
F c1 times f t
F c2 ρ x
λ c2 L_times
P c1 times c2
Δ c1 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-06
F c3
Δ c3 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-07
P c1 f c3
D c4 c1 times
D c5 c1 f
A c6 c4 x c5
P c1 t c6
P c0 a c1
D c7 c0 a
D c8 c7 t
P c0 foo c8
